    chraStakesP2: { en:"Accidents involving uncontrolled chemical exposure can trigger criminal liability for employers. Directors can be held personally accountable for inadequate controls.", ms:"Accidents involving uncontrolled chemical exposure can trigger criminal liability for employers. Directors can be held personally accountable for inadequate controls.", zh:"Accidents involving uncontrolled chemical exposure can trigger criminal liability for employers. Directors can be held personally accountable for inadequate controls.", ta:"Accidents involving uncontrolled chemical exposure can trigger criminal liability for employers. Directors can be held personally accountable for inadequate controls." },
