    cidbFailsText: { en:"Some providers offer cut-price \"certificates\" that CIDB does not recognise. Others conduct training in generic classrooms far from your site, causing worker downtime and transport costs. One-off training without renewal tracking leads to compliance gaps within months.", ms:"Some providers offer cut-price \"certificates\" that CIDB does not recognise. Others conduct training in generic classrooms far from your site, causing worker downtime and transport costs. One-off training without renewal tracking leads to compliance gaps within months.", zh:"Some providers offer cut-price \"certificates\" that CIDB does not recognise. Others conduct training in generic classrooms far from your site, causing worker downtime and transport costs. One-off training without renewal tracking leads to compliance gaps within months.", ta:"Some providers offer cut-price \"certificates\" that CIDB does not recognise. Others conduct training in generic classrooms far from your site, causing worker downtime and transport costs. One-off training without renewal tracking leads to compliance gaps within months." },
