    oshCoordStakesP2: { en:"Enforcement inspections have intensified since 2024. DOSH officers now specifically verify OSH-C appointment letters and competency certificates during site visits.", ms:"Enforcement inspections have intensified since 2024. DOSH officers now specifically verify OSH-C appointment letters and competency certificates during site visits.", zh:"Enforcement inspections have intensified since 2024. DOSH officers now specifically verify OSH-C appointment letters and competency certificates during site visits.", ta:"Enforcement inspections have intensified since 2024. DOSH officers now specifically verify OSH-C appointment letters and competency certificates during site visits." },
