    auditStakesP3: { en:"Failed audits damage your reputation with insurers, clients, and regulators. Some contracts require clean audit history as a pre-qualification criterion.", ms:"Failed audits damage your reputation with insurers, clients, and regulators. Some contracts require clean audit history as a pre-qualification criterion.", zh:"Failed audits damage your reputation with insurers, clients, and regulators. Some contracts require clean audit history as a pre-qualification criterion.", ta:"Failed audits damage your reputation with insurers, clients, and regulators. Some contracts require clean audit history as a pre-qualification criterion." },
