    wahHeroSubtitle: { en:"Fall arrest, full-body harness competency, and MEWP safety. The leading cause of construction fatalities in Malaysia. On-site delivery with real equipment.", ms:"Fall arrest, full-body harness competency, and MEWP safety. The leading cause of construction fatalities in Malaysia. On-site delivery with real equipment.", zh:"Fall arrest, full-body harness competency, and MEWP safety. The leading cause of construction fatalities in Malaysia. On-site delivery with real equipment.", ta:"Fall arrest, full-body harness competency, and MEWP safety. The leading cause of construction fatalities in Malaysia. On-site delivery with real equipment." },
